#: ../developer/automation-score.md:35
msgid ""
"The scoring methodology and the SQL that gathers per-user aggregates live"
" in **one** module (`serving.analytics.automation_score`), shared by the "
"admin endpoints and the CLI, so the two can never drift. The pure scoring"
" functions have no database dependency and are unit-tested in "
"`tests/unit/test_user_automation_score.py`."
