#: ../developer/automation-score.md:141
msgid ""
"SDKs sit at a neutral `0.5` because a human chat UI can sit on top of "
"`openai-python`. The `agent_share` term lets the coding-agent opener (see"
" below) pull the prior toward human even behind a scripty UA."
msgstr ""
"SDK 停在中性的 `0.5`，因为人用的聊天界面完全可能建在 `openai-python` 之上。`agent_share` 这一项让编码 "
"agent 开场白（见下文）即便藏在一个很像脚本的 UA 背后，也能把先验拉向人类。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:145
msgid "4. `daily_activity_shape` — daily activity"
msgstr "4\\. `daily_activity_shape`——日活动形态"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:147
msgid ""
"The behavioral fingerprint hardest to fake at scale. Up to four parts are"
" fused and re-normalized over whichever pass their data floors. Each is "
"HIGH = automation:"
msgstr "这是最难大规模伪造的行为指纹。最多融合四个分项，并在其中数据量达标的那些上重新归一化。每一项都是 HIGH = 自动化："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Part"
msgstr "分项"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "权重"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "公式"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Floor"
msgstr "数据下限"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Hour coverage"
msgstr "小时覆盖率"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "0.20"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid ""
"`clamp01((coverage - 0.5) / 0.5)`, `coverage = distinct active UTC hours "
"/ 24`"
msgstr ""
"`clamp01((coverage - 0.5) / 0.5)`，其中 `coverage = distinct active UTC hours / 24`——有活动的不同 UTC 小时数除以 24"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`N ≥ 10`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Hour entropy"
msgstr "小时熵"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid ""
"`clamp01((Hnorm - 0.5) / (0.92 - 0.5))`, `Hnorm = ShannonEntropy(hours) /"
" log2(24)`. The `0.92` is the ceiling at which this part saturates — a "
"hand-set tuning constant with no derivation in the code, unlike the other"
" numbers on this page"
msgstr ""
"`clamp01((Hnorm - 0.5) / (0.92 - 0.5))`，其中 `Hnorm = ShannonEntropy(hours) / log2(24)`。这里的 `0.92` 是该分项达到饱和的上限——它是一个手工设定的调参常数，代码里没有任何推导，与本页其他数字不同"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Nightly rest gap"
msgstr "夜间休息间隙"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "0.30"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`clamp01(1 - max_quiet_gap_hours / 6)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Inter-arrival regularity"
msgstr "到达间隔规律性"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`clamp01(1 - gap_rcv / 1.0)`, `gap_rcv = (p75 - p25) / median` of gaps"
msgstr "`clamp01(1 - gap_rcv / 1.0)`，其中 `gap_rcv = (p75 - p25) / median` 取自到达间隔"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`≥ 3 gaps`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:157
msgid ""
"`max_quiet_gap_hours` is the longest *circular* run of inactive clock-"
"hours — a human's nightly sleep gap pushes the rest-gap part toward 0, "
"while 24/7 operation leaves no gap (→ 1). The timezone-invariant parts "
"(regularity, rest gap, entropy) carry most of the weight, so an unknown "
"user timezone shifts the histogram without distorting the verdict (hours "
"are bucketed in **UTC**)."
msgstr ""
"`max_quiet_gap_hours` 是不活跃钟点的最长*环形*连续段——人类夜间睡眠形成的间隙会把休息间隙这一分项压向 0，而 7×24 "
"运行则完全没有间隙（→ 1）。与时区无关的几个分项（规律性、休息间隙、熵）占了大部分权重，所以用户时区未知只会平移直方图，不会扭曲结论（小时按 "
"**UTC** 分桶）。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:163
msgid "5. `tool_call_human_tell` — supporting"
msgstr "5\\. `tool_call_human_tell`——辅助信号"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:165
msgid ""
"Agentic tool use (`num_tool_calls > 0`, from OpenAI `tool_calls` / "
"Anthropic `tool_use` blocks) is the fingerprint of a human-driven coding "
"loop. It is a **one-directional** human tell: it is *dropped entirely* "
"when there are no tool calls (absence of tool use is not evidence of "
"automation), and otherwise can only pull the score toward human, never "
"raise it:"
msgstr ""
"Agentic 的工具调用（`num_tool_calls > 0`，来自 OpenAI 的 `tool_calls` / Anthropic 的"
" `tool_use` "
"块）是人驱动编码循环的指纹。它是**单向**的人类证据：没有任何工具调用时它被*整个丢弃*（没有工具调用并不等于是自动化），而在有工具调用时它只能把评分拉向人类，绝不会抬高评分："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:175
msgid "6. `agent_opener_override` — supporting"
msgstr "6\\. `agent_opener_override`——辅助信号"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:177
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"`metadata->>'agent'` is a coding-agent identity parsed from the system-"
"prompt opener (`\"You are Claude Code, …\"`). Because it is content-"
"derived (not a header), it is hard to fake incidentally and is treated as"
" strong human evidence. It is available only when the opener appears on ≥"
" 5% of requests, so it can only pull toward human; its absence is "
"uninformative:"
msgstr ""
"`metadata->>'agent'` 是从 system prompt 开场白（`\"You are Claude Code, "
"…\"`）里解析出来的编码 agent 身份。因为它来自内容而不是请求头，很难被无意间伪造，所以被当作强的人类证据。只有当这个开场白出现在 ≥ "
"5% 的请求上时它才可用，因此它只能把评分拉向人类；它的缺席不提供任何信息："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:187
msgid "It also drives the **hard human clamp** in the combination step."
msgstr "它同时驱动组合步骤里的**人类硬钳制**。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:189
msgid "7. `user_message_shape` — user-message size & entropy"
msgstr "7\\. `user_message_shape`——用户消息长度与熵"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:191
msgid ""
"Where `prompt_size_dispersion` looks at the *whole* input, this signal "
"looks at the **user's own messages**. Three properties of the **newest "
"user-role message** per request are precomputed at log time (in "
"`user_message_stats`, alongside `conversation_shape`) as cheap columns — "
"char length, Shannon character entropy (bits/char), and a stable 64-bit "
"hash of the stripped text — so the score never de-TOASTs the prompt. "
"Three parts are fused and re-normalized over whichever pass their floors,"
" each HIGH = automation:"
msgstr ""
"`prompt_size_dispersion` 看的是*整个*输入，而这个信号看的是**用户自己写的消息**。每个请求中**最新一条 user "
"角色消息**的三个属性会在写日志时预先算好（存在 `user_message_stats`，与 `conversation_shape` "
"并列）作为廉价的列——字符长度、香农字符熵（bit/字符），以及剥离后文本的稳定 64 位哈希——这样评分就永远不需要对 prompt 做 de-"
"TOAST。三个分项会被融合，并在其中达到下限的那些上重新归一化，每一项都是 HIGH = 自动化："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Size dispersion"
msgstr "长度离散度"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "0.40"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid ""
"`clamp01(1 - size_rcv / 0.5)`, `size_rcv = (p75 - p25)/median` of "
"`last_user_msg_chars`"
msgstr ""
"`clamp01(1 - size_rcv / 0.5)`，其中 `size_rcv = (p75 - p25)/median` 取自 "
"`last_user_msg_chars`"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`≥ 8 sized msgs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Per-message entropy"
msgstr "单条消息熵"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "0.25"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`clamp01(1 - mean_entropy / 4.0)` (natural language ≈ 4 bits/char)"
msgstr "`clamp01(1 - mean_entropy / 4.0)`（自然语言 ≈ 4 bit/字符）"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`≥ 5 msgs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Cross-message repetition"
msgstr "跨消息重复度"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "0.35"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid ""
"`clamp01((1 - distinct_ratio) / 0.5)`, `distinct_ratio = "
"distinct(hash)/count`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`≥ 8 hashed msgs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:205
msgid ""
"Templated automation sends near-constant-length user messages (low size "
"dispersion), low-entropy structured payloads, and resends the same "
"message over and over (low distinct ratio → high repetition); an "
"interactive human varies all three. Because the columns are populated "
"only for new traffic, the signal is simply unavailable (dropped) for "
"users whose requests all predate the migration."
msgstr ""
"模板化的自动化发出的用户消息长度几乎恒定（长度离散度低）、载荷是低熵的结构化内容，并且一遍遍重发同一条消息（去重比例低 → "
"重复度高）；交互式的人类三者都在变。由于这些列只对新流量填充，对于请求全部早于该次迁移的用户，这个信号直接不可用（被丢弃）。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:211
msgid ""
"This signal isolates the user input, which the metadata in "
"`metadata->>'agent'` and the per-message hash make hard to spoof without "
"actually varying the content."
msgstr "这个信号把用户输入单独隔离出来，再配合 `metadata->>'agent'` 里的元数据和逐消息哈希，不真正改变内容就很难伪造。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:214
msgid "Combining the signals"
msgstr "信号的组合"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:234
msgid ""
"**Re-normalization** (`raw`) makes the blend depend only on the signals "
"that actually had data, so a pure-embeddings batch user — whose "
"`num_*_turns` columns are all `NULL` — is still scored on its user-agent "
"and daily-activity shape."
msgstr ""
"**重新归一化**（`raw`）让融合只取决于确实有数据的信号，所以一个纯 embedding 的批量用户——它的 `num_*_turns` "
"列全是 `NULL`——仍然可以凭 user-agent 和日活动形态被评分。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:237
msgid ""
"**Shrinkage** (`alpha = N / (N + 30)`) pulls users with little traffic "
"toward the neutral `0.5` prior. Data outweighs the prior at `N = 30` "
"(`alpha = 0.5`); at `N = 5`, `alpha ≈ 0.14` (the score is pulled ~86% to "
"`0.5`)."
msgstr ""
"**收缩**（`alpha = N / (N + 30)`）把流量很少的用户拉向中性的 `0.5` 先验。在 `N = 30` "
"时数据的分量超过先验（`alpha = 0.5`）；在 `N = 5` 时 `alpha ≈ 0.14`（评分被拉向 `0.5` 约 86%）。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:240
msgid ""
"**`confidence`** combines the request volume (`alpha`) with the share of "
"the total signal weight that was actually available (`weight_sum / "
"TOTAL_WEIGHT`), so sparse verdicts — and users missing the newer signals "
"— read as lower-confidence."
msgstr ""
"**`confidence`** 把请求量（`alpha`）与实际可用的信号权重占比（`weight_sum / "
"TOTAL_WEIGHT`）结合起来，所以稀疏的结论——以及缺少较新信号的用户——读出来置信度更低。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:244
msgid "Users with `N < 5` requests are flagged **`insufficient_data`**."
msgstr "请求数 `N < 5` 的用户会被标记为 **`insufficient_data`**。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:246
msgid "Bands"
msgstr "档位"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:248
msgid ""
"The final score maps to a band label (advisory — always read with "
"`confidence`):"
msgstr "最终评分映射到一个档位标签（仅供参考——务必结合 `confidence` 一起读）："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:250
msgid ""
"The lower bound is inclusive and the upper bound exclusive (`SCORE_BANDS`"
" is scanned top-down with `score >= lower`), so `0.35`, `0.60` and `0.80`"
" each fall in the band above:"
msgstr ""
"下界闭、上界开（`SCORE_BANDS` 自上而下扫描，判据是 `score >= lower`），所以 `0.35`、`0.60` 和 `0.80` 各自落在上面那一档："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Band"
msgstr "档位"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "Range"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`likely_human`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`0.00 ≤ s < 0.35`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`mixed_or_uncertain`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`0.35 ≤ s < 0.60`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`likely_automated`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`0.60 ≤ s < 0.80`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`scripted_batch`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:13
msgid "`0.80 ≤ s ≤ 1.00`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:261
msgid "Caveats"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:263
msgid ""
"**It's a heuristic.** No single signal is decisive; each is individually "
"spoofable, so the user-agent is weighted low and behavioral signals "
"dominate. Treat the score as triage, not proof."
msgstr ""
"**这是启发式的**。没有任何单个信号是决定性的；每一个都可以被单独伪造，所以 user-agent "
"权重很低，行为类信号占主导。把评分当作分诊线索，而不是证据。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:266
msgid ""
"**Timezone.** Hour-of-day is bucketed in UTC; the design leans on the "
"timezone-invariant daily-activity parts so a non-UTC human is not "
"mislabeled as night-active, but a genuinely multi-timezone account can "
"inflate hour coverage."
msgstr ""
"**时区**。小时按 UTC 分桶；设计上依靠与时区无关的日活动分项，因此非 UTC "
"时区的人不会被误标成夜间活跃，但一个真正跨多时区的账号确实会抬高小时覆盖率。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:269
msgid ""
"**Shared / role accounts.** Shared or team accounts blend human and "
"script traffic into a mid \"mixed\" score (correct). `internal` / `admin`"
" accounts may legitimately run automation — the score stays role-"
"agnostic, so exclude them from any automated enforcement and read the "
"score with their role in mind."
msgstr ""
"**共享 / 角色账号**。共享账号或团队账号会把人类流量与脚本流量混成中间的「mixed」分数（这是对的）。`internal` / "
"`admin` 账号运行自动化本身可能完全合理——评分不区分角色，所以要把它们排除在任何自动处置之外，并结合其角色来读评分。"

